	(text "the SDA is connected to GPio 21(D21) and the SCL is connected to GPI22\nVDD go to 5v supply\nGND connected to common GND\nThe ADC pin is then connected to the vout of the ACS712 (current sensor)\nthe IP- is connected to possitve of the pump\nthe IP+ is connected to possitve of the power supply"
